# Feature services

- Keep services focused on orchestration and business rules for one domain.
- No React imports, no UI logic, no direct HTTP request/response handling.
- Delegate persistence to `*.repository.ts` and provider calls to `*.adapter.ts`.
- Validate external input with Zod schemas before persisting or calling providers.
- Throw domain errors with stable codes; map to API responses only in route handlers.
- Prefer deterministic logic; use LLMs only through adapters with schema-validated output.
